  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Small Grants Program-Laos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment funds small value and low risk development activities that complement Australia&apos;s development cooperation program in Laos.  The investment aims to contribute to reduced poverty and support small-scale development activities. Activities  include, but are not limited to, supporting community health, schools, small-scale infrastructure, activities promoting women&#x2019;s empowerment, indigenous groups and vulnerable minority groups (including people with disabilities), governance, human rights, environment, and proposals with a strong advocacy component.</narrative>
  </description>
